{"seq":1,"slug":"wasm-bindgen","title":"wasm-bindgen 绑定生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/wasm-bindgen","wordCount":950,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"wasm-bindgen-绑定生成器\">wasm-bindgen 绑定生成器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>wasm-bindgen</code> 解决的是 Rust 与 JS 之间<strong>类型与语义不匹配</strong>的问题：WASM 原生只认数值类型，而两者的对象模型、字符串编码、错误处理方式都不同。它采用<strong>过程宏 + CLI 工具</strong>的两阶段设计——<code>#[wasm_bindgen]</code> 宏在编译期收集导出/导入元数据，CLI 再据此生成类型安全的胶水代码。跨边界的核心载体是 <code>JsValue</code>，任何不能直接映射的 JS 值都通过它传递；Rust 结构体可导出为 JS 类，但需手动 <code>.free()</code> 释放。通过 <code>extern &quot;C&quot;</code> 块还能导入任意 JS API，配合 <code>catch</code> 属性实现异常安全调用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心机制\">核心机制</h2><p><code>wasm-bindgen</code> 是 Rust WASM 生态的基石，它在 Rust 和 JavaScript 之间生成类型安全的胶水代码，让两个世界的交互变得透明。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn greet(name: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;    format!(&quot;你好, {}！欢迎来到 WASM 世界&quot;, name)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn greet(name: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format!(\"你好, {}！欢迎来到 WASM 世界\", name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import init, { greet } from &#39;./pkg/my_wasm.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;await init();&#10;const message = greet(&#39;开发者&#39;);&#10;console.log(message);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> init, { greet } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './pkg/my_wasm.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'开发者'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message);</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    RUST[&quot;Rust 函数&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;#[wasm_bindgen]&quot;| MACRO[&quot;过程宏处理&quot;]&#10;    MACRO --&gt; GLUE[&quot;生成 JS 胶水代码&quot;]&#10;    MACRO --&gt; WASM[&quot;生成 WASM 导出&quot;]&#10;    GLUE --&gt; BRIDGE[&quot;JS ↔ WASM 桥接层&quot;]&#10;    WASM --&gt; BRIDGE&#10;    BRIDGE --&gt; APP[&quot;应用调用&quot;]\">graph LR\n    RUST[\"Rust 函数\"] --&gt;|\"#[wasm_bindgen]\"| MACRO[\"过程宏处理\"]\n    MACRO --&gt; GLUE[\"生成 JS 胶水代码\"]\n    MACRO --&gt; WASM[\"生成 WASM 导出\"]\n    GLUE --&gt; BRIDGE[\"JS ↔ WASM 桥接层\"]\n    WASM --&gt; BRIDGE\n    BRIDGE --&gt; APP[\"应用调用\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>wasm-bindgen 宏</td>\n<td>Rust 源码中</td>\n<td>标记导出函数/类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLI 工具</td>\n<td>wasm-bindgen CLI</td>\n<td>处理 .wasm 生成胶水代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS 胶水</td>\n<td><code>pkg/*.js</code></td>\n<td>类型转换与内存管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript 声明</td>\n<td><code>pkg/*.d.ts</code></td>\n<td>类型定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASM 二进制</td>\n<td><code>pkg/*.wasm</code></td>\n<td>编译后的二进制模块</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>wasm-bindgen</code> 宏在编译期生成额外的自定义段嵌入 WASM 文件中，<code>wasm-bindgen</code> CLI 读取这些段来生成对应的 JS 代码。这个两阶段流程是理解工具链的关键。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasm_bindgen-属性详解\">#[wasm_bindgen] 属性详解</h2><p><code>#[wasm_bindgen]</code> 支持多种属性配置，控制导出行为和跨边界交互方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen(js_name = &quot;calculateSum&quot;)]&#10;pub fn calculate_sum(values: &amp;[f64]) -&gt; f64 {&#10;    values.iter().sum()&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = Math)]&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; {&#10;    fn random() -&gt; f64;&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen(module = &quot;/src/helper.js&quot;)]&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; {&#10;    fn customLog(message: &amp;str);&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen(start)]&#10;fn main() {&#10;    console_error_panic_hook::set_once();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen(js_name = \"calculateSum\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn calculate_sum(values: &#x26;[f64]) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    values.iter().sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = Math)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn random() -> f64;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen(module = \"/src/helper.js\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn customLog(message: &#x26;str);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen(start)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console_error_panic_hook::set_once();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>js_name</code></td>\n<td>导出</td>\n<td>自定义 JS 侧的函数/类名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>js_namespace</code></td>\n<td>导入</td>\n<td>指定 JS 命名空间（如 <code>Math</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>module</code></td>\n<td>导入</td>\n<td>从指定 JS 模块导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>start</code></td>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>模块初始化时自动调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>constructor</code></td>\n<td>方法</td>\n<td>标记为构造函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getter</code> / <code>setter</code></td>\n<td>方法</td>\n<td>标记为属性访问器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>structural</code></td>\n<td>导入</td>\n<td>使用鸭子类型而非原型链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>catch</code></td>\n<td>导入</td>\n<td>捕获 JS 异常为 <code>Result</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>readonly</code></td>\n<td>字段</td>\n<td>只读属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>skip_jsdoc</code></td>\n<td>导出</td>\n<td>跳过 JSDoc 生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"js-rust-边界与-jsvalue\">JS↔Rust 边界与 JsValue</h2><p><code>JsValue</code> 是 wasm-bindgen 中表示任意 JavaScript 值的类型，是跨边界通信的核心枢纽。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn process_value(val: JsValue) -&gt; Result&lt;JsValue, JsValue&gt; {&#10;    if val.is_string() {&#10;        let s = val.as_string().unwrap();&#10;        Ok(JsValue::from_str(&amp;s.to_uppercase()))&#10;    } else if val.is_falsy() {&#10;        Err(JsValue::from_str(&quot;收到假值&quot;))&#10;    } else {&#10;        Ok(val)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn process_value(val: JsValue) -> Result&#x3C;JsValue, JsValue> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if val.is_string() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let s = val.as_string().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(JsValue::from_str(&#x26;s.to_uppercase()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else if val.is_falsy() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(JsValue::from_str(\"收到假值\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(val)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    RUST_TYPES[&quot;Rust 类型&quot;] --&gt; BRIDGE[&quot;wasm-bindgen 桥接&quot;]&#10;    JS_TYPES[&quot;JS 类型&quot;] --&gt; BRIDGE&#10;    BRIDGE --&gt; JSVALUE[&quot;JsValue&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 类型映射&#10;        R_STR[&quot;&amp;str / String&quot;] -.-&gt; J_STR[&quot;string&quot;]&#10;        R_NUM[&quot;i32/u32/f64&quot;] -.-&gt; J_NUM[&quot;number&quot;]&#10;        R_BOOL[&quot;bool&quot;] -.-&gt; J_BOOL[&quot;boolean&quot;]&#10;        R_VEC[&quot;Vec&lt;u8&gt;&quot;] -.-&gt; J_UINT8[&quot;Uint8Array&quot;]&#10;        R_OPT[&quot;Option&lt;T&gt;&quot;] -.-&gt; J_NULL[&quot;T | undefined&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    RUST_TYPES[\"Rust 类型\"] --&gt; BRIDGE[\"wasm-bindgen 桥接\"]\n    JS_TYPES[\"JS 类型\"] --&gt; BRIDGE\n    BRIDGE --&gt; JSVALUE[\"JsValue\"]\n\n    subgraph 类型映射\n        R_STR[\"&amp;str / String\"] -.-&gt; J_STR[\"string\"]\n        R_NUM[\"i32/u32/f64\"] -.-&gt; J_NUM[\"number\"]\n        R_BOOL[\"bool\"] -.-&gt; J_BOOL[\"boolean\"]\n        R_VEC[\"Vec&lt;u8&gt;\"] -.-&gt; J_UINT8[\"Uint8Array\"]\n        R_OPT[\"Option&lt;T&gt;\"] -.-&gt; J_NULL[\"T | undefined\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rust 类型</th>\n<th>JS 类型</th>\n<th>传递方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>i32</code> / <code>u32</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>直接传值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i64</code> / <code>u64</code></td>\n<td><code>bigint</code></td>\n<td>BigInt 转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>f32</code> / <code>f64</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>直接传值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td><code>boolean</code></td>\n<td>直接传值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;str</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>拷贝到线性内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>拷贝 + 所有权转移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;u8&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Uint8Array</code></td>\n<td>拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T | undefined</code></td>\n<td>条件转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T</code> 或抛出异常</td>\n<td>异常映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>JsValue</code></td>\n<td><code>any</code></td>\n<td>引用传递</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 每次跨边界传递字符串都会触发一次内存拷贝（UTF-8 ↔ UTF-16 转换）。如果你的函数在热路径上频繁交换字符串，考虑改用共享线性内存中的字节数组，避免拷贝开销。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义类型跨边界\">自定义类型跨边界</h2><p>wasm-bindgen 支持将 Rust 结构体和枚举导出为 JS 类，实现面向对象的跨语言交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub struct Particle {&#10;    x: f64,&#10;    y: f64,&#10;    vx: f64,&#10;    vy: f64,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;impl Particle {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]&#10;    pub fn new(x: f64, y: f64) -&gt; Particle {&#10;        Particle { x, y, vx: 0.0, vy: 0.0 }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn apply_force(&amp;mut self, fx: f64, fy: f64) {&#10;        self.vx += fx;&#10;        self.vy += fy;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn step(&amp;mut self, dt: f64) {&#10;        self.x += self.vx * dt;&#10;        self.y += self.vy * dt;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]&#10;    pub fn x(&amp;self) -&gt; f64 {&#10;        self.x&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]&#10;    pub fn y(&amp;self) -&gt; f64 {&#10;        self.y&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub enum Direction {&#10;    Up,&#10;    Down,&#10;    Left,&#10;    Right,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct Particle {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x: f64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y: f64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vx: f64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vy: f64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Particle {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(x: f64, y: f64) -> Particle {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Particle { x, y, vx: 0.0, vy: 0.0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn apply_force(&#x26;mut self, fx: f64, fy: f64) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.vx += fx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.vy += fy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn step(&#x26;mut self, dt: f64) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.x += self.vx * dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.y += self.vy * dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn x(&#x26;self) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn y(&#x26;self) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub enum Direction {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Up,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Down,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Left,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Right,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Particle, Direction } from &#39;./pkg/my_wasm.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;const p = new Particle(100.0, 200.0);&#10;p.apply_force(0.5, -0.3);&#10;p.step(1.0 / 60.0);&#10;console.log(`位置: (${p.x}, ${p.y})`);&#10;p.free();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Particle, Direction } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './pkg/my_wasm.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Particle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apply_force</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`位置: (${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">})`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">free</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>支持情况</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公有字段</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>自动生成 getter/setter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有字段</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>JS 侧不可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方法</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td><code>&amp;self</code>/<code>&amp;mut self</code>/消费 self</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构造函数</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td><code>#[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枚举</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>映射为 JS 数字常量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>需要具体化后导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trait 对象</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>需要封装为具体结构体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期参数</td>\n<td>⚠️ 受限</td>\n<td>仅支持 <code>&#39;static</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 导出的 Rust 结构体在 JS 侧使用完毕后需要调用 <code>.free()</code> 释放。如果忘记调用，内存不会自动回收（WASM 没有 GC）。考虑使用 <code>FinalizationRegistry</code> 做安全网，但不要依赖它。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"导入-js-api\">导入 JS API</h2><p>wasm-bindgen 不仅能导出 Rust 函数，也能导入 JavaScript API 供 Rust 代码使用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = console)]&#10;    fn log(s: &amp;str);&#10;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = console, js_name = log)]&#10;    fn log_u32(a: u32);&#10;&#10;    type HTMLDocument;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(method, getter)]&#10;    fn title(this: &amp;HTMLDocument) -&gt; String;&#10;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = JSON)]&#10;    fn stringify(val: &amp;JsValue) -&gt; JsValue;&#10;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(catch, js_namespace = JSON)]&#10;    fn parse(text: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;JsValue, JsValue&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn demo() {&#10;    log(&quot;从 Rust 调用 console.log&quot;);&#10;    log_u32(42);&#10;&#10;    match JSON::parse(&quot;{\\&quot;key\\&quot;: \\&quot;value\\&quot;}&quot;) {&#10;        Ok(val) =&gt; log(&amp;format!(&quot;解析成功&quot;)),&#10;        Err(e) =&gt; log(&amp;format!(&quot;解析失败&quot;)),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = console)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn log(s: &#x26;str);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = console, js_name = log)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn log_u32(a: u32);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type HTMLDocument;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(method, getter)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn title(this: &#x26;HTMLDocument) -> String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = JSON)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn stringify(val: &#x26;JsValue) -> JsValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(catch, js_namespace = JSON)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn parse(text: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;JsValue, JsValue>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn demo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log(\"从 Rust 调用 console.log\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log_u32(42);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match JSON::parse(\"{\\\"key\\\": \\\"value\\\"}\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(val) => log(&#x26;format!(\"解析成功\")),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(e) => log(&#x26;format!(\"解析失败\")),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((wasm-bindgen))&#10;    核心机制&#10;      过程宏标记&#10;      两阶段生成&#10;      JS 胶水代码&#10;    属性系统&#10;      js_name 重命名&#10;      js_namespace 命名空间&#10;      catch 异常捕获&#10;    JsValue&#10;      任意 JS 值&#10;      类型检查方法&#10;      跨边界桥梁&#10;    自定义类型&#10;      结构体→JS 类&#10;      枚举→数字常量&#10;      需手动 free&#10;    导入 JS API&#10;      extern C 声明&#10;      console/DOM/JSON&#10;      catch 处理异常\">mindmap\n  root((wasm-bindgen))\n    核心机制\n      过程宏标记\n      两阶段生成\n      JS 胶水代码\n    属性系统\n      js_name 重命名\n      js_namespace 命名空间\n      catch 异常捕获\n    JsValue\n      任意 JS 值\n      类型检查方法\n      跨边界桥梁\n    自定义类型\n      结构体→JS 类\n      枚举→数字常量\n      需手动 free\n    导入 JS API\n      extern C 声明\n      console/DOM/JSON\n      catch 处理异常</pre><ul>\n<li><code>wasm-bindgen</code> 通过<strong>过程宏 + CLI 工具</strong>的两阶段流程，在 Rust 和 JS 之间生成类型安全的胶水代码。</li>\n<li><code>#[wasm_bindgen]</code> 属性支持 <code>js_name</code>、<code>constructor</code>、<code>getter</code>/<code>setter</code>、<code>catch</code> 等丰富的配置项。</li>\n<li><code>JsValue</code> 是跨边界通信的核心类型，所有不能直接映射的 JS 值都通过它传递。</li>\n<li>Rust 结构体可导出为 JS 类，支持方法和属性，但<strong>必须手动调用 <code>.free()</code> 释放内存</strong>。</li>\n<li>通过 <code>extern &quot;C&quot;</code> 块可以导入任意 JS API，配合 <code>catch</code> 属性实现异常安全的调用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"wasm-bindgen 绑定生成器","id":"wasm-bindgen-绑定生成器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心机制","id":"核心机制"},{"level":2,"text":"#[wasm_bindgen] 属性详解","id":"wasm_bindgen-属性详解"},{"level":2,"text":"JS↔Rust 边界与 JsValue","id":"js-rust-边界与-jsvalue"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义类型跨边界","id":"自定义类型跨边界"},{"level":2,"text":"导入 JS API","id":"导入-js-api"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/execution-model"},"next":{"title":"wasm-pack 打包工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/wasm-pack"}}